  "description": "On-device LLM inference for Circle. Alibaba MNN P/Invoke layer with Qwen 3 chat generator. 1.3.4 adds osx-x64 + android-arm64 + codesigns all macOS dylibs with the \"Apple Distribution: The Other Bhengu (Pty) Ltd (78QHBHRR7Q)\" cert. osx-x64: libmnnbridge.dylib built with -DCMAKE_OSX_ARCHITECTURES=x86_64; libMNN.dylib reused (universal x64+arm64). android-arm64: libmnnbridge.so built via NDK r26d toolchain against the Alibaba Android MNN 3.5.0 prebuilt — Android ships LLM symbols in a separate libllm.so (not libMNN.so), so the link command pulls in libllm.so + libMNN_Express.so + libMNN.so. NuGet payload now ships all required Android companion .so files (libMNN, libllm, libMNN_Express, libmnncore, libc++_shared, libMNN_CL, libMNN_Vulkan, libMNNAudio, libMNNOpenCV) under runtimes/android-arm64/native/. 5 RIDs total: win-x64, linux-x64, osx-arm64, osx-x64, android-arm64. 1.3.3 added osx-arm64; 1.3.2 linux-x64; 1.3.1 fixed Windows.",
